window.CONTRACT_SUDU={"3-1-1": {"tree": "【合約前言 Preamble 例一・骨架】\n├ ① 分類觀念\n│   ├ principal terms 主要條款 ── 交易標的＋交易條件（freight agreement：運什麼、何時運、運費）\n│   └ general terms 一般條款 ── 語言、管轄法院、準據法\n├ ② 前言兩大功能\n│   ├ 記載交易與合約之目的\n│   └ 記載當事人名稱、地址、簡稱（hereinafter referred to as）\n├ ③ 第一段 Parties\n│   ├ 簽約日 signed on the 21st day of May, 2012\n│   ├ by and between A and B\n│   ├ 屬性 a Hong Kong Company／having an office at [address]\n│   └ 簡稱 \"ABC HK\"／\"Manufacturer\"\n├ ④ WITNESSETH ＋ WHEREAS ×6（Recitals 背景）\n│   ├ ① Manufacturer is engaged in manufacturing（產品定義 the \"Products\"）\n│   ├ ② ABC HK = indirect, wholly-owned subsidiary of ABC（美國）\n│   ├ ③ home office／representative offices／product sourcing\n│   ├ ④ procurement on behalf of ABC and its affiliates, as buying agent\n│   ├ ⑤ trade names, service marks, trademarks… derivatives thereof（the \"Trademarks\"）\n│   └ ⑥ all Trademarks owned by ABC；licensed to Manufacturer pursuant to this Agreement\n└ ⑤ NOW, THEREFORE（分水嶺）\n    └ in consideration of the mutual covenants herein contained → the parties hereby agree as follows", "quiz": [{"q": "In a freight agreement, the clause specifying **what goods are to be transported and how the freight is calculated** is best classified as:", "o": [["A", "a general term"], ["B", "a principal term"], ["C", "a recital"], ["D", "a boilerplate clause"]], "a": "(B) a principal term", "zh": "在貨物運送合約中，規定運送何種貨物、運費如何計算的條款，屬於主要條款。", "e": "主要條款＝交易標的與交易條件；準據法、管轄法院、語言那種輔助性條款才是 general terms（一般條款／boilerplate）。"}, {"q": "\"WHEREAS Manufacturer is engaged in the manufacturing of clothes and accessories (the \"Products\");\" — the function of this sentence is to:", "o": [["A", "impose a manufacturing obligation on Manufacturer"], ["B", "recite background and define a term used later"], ["C", "grant a trademark licence"], ["D", "set the governing law"]], "a": "(B) recite background and define a term used later", "zh": "此句功能在交代背景並定義後文會用到的「產品」一詞。", "e": "WHEREAS 條款是 recitals，原則上不創設義務；要有拘束力必須寫進本文條款。順帶注意括號 (the \"Products\") 就是在**定義用語**。"}, {"q": "In \"all combinations, forms and derivatives thereof\", the word **thereof** refers to:", "o": [["A", "this Agreement"], ["B", "the Products manufactured by Manufacturer"], ["C", "the trade names, marks, logos and emblems listed earlier in the same sentence"], ["D", "the affiliates of ABC"]], "a": "(C) the trade names, marks, logos and emblems listed earlier in the same sentence", "zh": "thereof 指同一句前面列舉的那些商業名稱、標章、商標、標記。", "e": "here-／there- 系列代名詞永遠先問「指誰」：hereof＝of this Agreement；thereof＝of that（前面剛提到的事物）。書中特別以此句解說。"}, {"q": "Choose the sentence that correctly starts the operative part of the contract:", "o": [["A", "WITNESSETH, the parties agree as follows:"], ["B", "NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants herein contained, the parties hereby agree as follows:"], ["C", "WHEREAS, in consideration of this Agreement, the parties agreed as follows:"], ["D", "IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties hereby agree as follows:"]], "a": "(B)", "zh": "正式進入權利義務本文的句子是 NOW, THEREFORE…the parties hereby agree as follows:。", "e": "IN WITNESS WHEREOF 是**結尾簽名欄**用語（茲證明雙方於文首所載日期簽署），不要和開頭的 NOW, THEREFORE 搞混，這是常見陷阱。"}, {"q": "\"as are from time to time used by ABC or any of its affiliates, whether registered or unregistered\" means the Trademarks covered are:", "o": [["A", "only those registered at the date of signing"], ["B", "only those used occasionally"], ["C", "those in use at any given time, registered or not"], ["D", "those used exclusively by ABC itself"]], "a": "(C) those in use at any given time, registered or not", "zh": "指各該時點所使用者，不論是否註冊，也包括關係企業使用的。", "e": "from time to time＝「於各該時點」而非「偶爾」；whether registered or unregistered 把未註冊商標一併納入；or any of its affiliates 把關係企業也包含進來。三個修飾語都在**放寬**範圍。"}], "say": ["合約前言例一。先記兩個分類：principal terms 主要條款，談的是交易標的與交易條件；general terms 一般條款，談語言、管轄法院與準據法。", "前言有兩個功能：記載交易與合約之目的，以及記載當事人名稱、地址與簡稱。", "第一段固定三件事：簽約日、當事人全名與屬性、地址與簡稱。關鍵句型：THIS AGREEMENT signed on the twenty-first day of May, two thousand twelve, by and between A and B, hereinafter referred to as…", "接著是 WITNESSETH 與 WHEREAS，交代背景與交易動機，原則上不創設義務，但會影響日後條文解釋。", "最後是分水嶺 NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual covenants herein contained, the parties hereby agree as follows. 這句之後才是權利義務本文。", "三個高頻陷阱：thereof 指前面剛提到的事物；from time to time 是於各該時點而非偶爾；in consideration of 是對價，不是考慮到。"], "saya": ["e8b2aab41038", "2c8af330bced", "77cf7c3bfb90", "5d69908ddf52", "3b7b75ead075", "6e1eca8892a6"]}, "3-1-2": {"tree": "【合約前言 Preamble 例二・股權買賣骨架】\n├ ① 簽約日單獨一句：THIS AGREEMENT is made on October 28th, 2012.\n├ ② 當事人 BETWEEN … AND …（名稱與註冊地址並列，書評：較為清楚）\n│   ├ Vendor＝A PTE. Limited，incorporated in the Republic of Singapore\n│   ├ Purchaser＝B Limited，incorporated in Taiwan, Republic of China\n│   └ 三件事：incorporated in／company registration number／registered office\n├ ③ WHEREAS: (a)-(g) ＝ 一張盡職調查地圖\n│   ├ (a) 標的公司 C PTE. LTD.（the \"Company\"）private company limited by shares（新加坡）\n│   ├ (b) sole asset＝investment in D Ltd.，D Ltd. operates a factory in PRC\n│   ├ (c) share capital of 2 ordinary shares，issued and fully paid\n│   ├ (d) Vendor＝registered AND beneficial owner，representing 100% of issued and paid-up share capital\n│   ├ (e) by Completion Date：capitalize US$81,526,793 shareholders loan → 81,526,793 ordinary shares（債轉股）\n│   ├ (f) At Completion：81,526,793 issued and fully paid-up ordinary shares ＝ the \"Sale Shares\"\n│   └ (g) Purchaser desires to purchase／Vendor desires to sell, on the terms and subject to the conditions\n├ ④ NOW THEREFORE（比例一多了 representations、warranties）\n│   └ in consideration of the mutual agreements, representations, warranties and subject to the conditions\n│     contained herein, the parties hereto hereby agree as follows:\n└ ⑤ 第一條：Definitions and Interpretation 定義及解釋", "quiz": [{"q": "\"the Vendor is the registered and beneficial owner of the 2 ordinary shares\" — why are **both** words used?", "o": [["A", "they are synonyms used for emphasis"], ["B", "legal title and economic ownership can be held by different persons"], ["C", "\"registered\" refers to the company, \"beneficial\" to the shares"], ["D", "it is required by Singapore tax law"]], "a": "(B) legal title and economic ownership can be held by different persons", "zh": "因為註冊名義人與受益人可能是不同的人（借名登記／信託）。", "e": "只查股東名簿（registered owner）不足以確認賣方有權處分；若有 nominee／trust arrangement，受益人另有其人，買方可能買到有瑕疵的股權。"}, {"q": "\"The Vendor intends to capitalize US$81,526,793 of its shareholders loan into 81,526,793 ordinary shares of the Company by Completion Date.\" The effect is to:", "o": [["A", "repay the loan in cash before Completion"], ["B", "convert the Vendor's loan claim into newly issued shares"], ["C", "write off the loan without consideration"], ["D", "transfer the loan to the Purchaser"]], "a": "(B) convert the Vendor's loan claim into newly issued shares", "zh": "把賣方對標的公司的貸款債權轉換為新發行的股份（債轉股）。", "e": "這就是為什麼股本從 (c) 的 2 股暴增為 (f) 的 81,526,793 股：資本化後買方一次買下乾淨的股權，交割後公司帳上不再有股東貸款。"}, {"q": "Recital (b) says the Company's sole asset is its investment in D Ltd., which operates a factory in the PRC. For the Purchaser's due diligence this means:", "o": [["A", "only the Company's own accounts matter"], ["B", "the real value sits one level down, so D Ltd. and the factory must also be investigated"], ["C", "the transaction is a pure asset purchase"], ["D", "PRC law is irrelevant because the Company is Singaporean"]], "a": "(B) the real value sits one level down, so D Ltd. and the factory must also be investigated", "zh": "真正的價值在下一層，必須一併查 D Ltd. 與該工廠。", "e": "標的公司只是控股 SPV，買股權等於間接買下那座中國工廠。土地廠房權利、環保、勞動、關係人交易與 PRC 法令都要納入盡職調查。"}, {"q": "Compared with Example 1, the NOW THEREFORE clause in Example 2 additionally refers to:", "o": [["A", "consideration"], ["B", "representations and warranties"], ["C", "the recitals"], ["D", "the governing law"]], "a": "(B) representations and warranties", "zh": "例二的 NOW THEREFORE 多了「表述與保證」。", "e": "in consideration of the mutual agreements, representations, warranties and subject to the conditions contained herein——陳述與保證是股權買賣的核心：不實時買方可請求損害賠償（warranty）或主張不實表示（misrepresentation）。"}, {"q": "In \"the parties hereto hereby agree as follows\", **hereto** means:", "o": [["A", "of this Agreement"], ["B", "to this Agreement"], ["C", "in this Agreement"], ["D", "under that document"]], "a": "(B) to this Agreement", "zh": "hereto＝to this Agreement（本合約之）。", "e": "成套記：hereof＝of this Agreement；hereto＝to this Agreement；herein＝in this Agreement；hereunder＝under this Agreement；thereof＝of that（前述事物）。"}], "say": ["合約前言例二，股權買賣。簽約日單獨成句：THIS AGREEMENT is made on October twenty-eighth, two thousand twelve.", "當事人用 BETWEEN … AND … 分段列出，書上說，把名稱與註冊地址並列呈現比較清楚。賣方 A PTE Limited 是新加坡公司，買方 B Limited 是我國公司。每一方都要寫三件事：incorporated in 設立地、company registration number 公司註冊號碼、registered office 註冊營業所。", "WHEREAS 用 a 到 g 編號，等於一張盡職調查地圖。a 標的公司，b 唯一資產是對 D Ltd. 的投資，而 D 公司在中國營運一座工廠，c 股本只有兩股普通股且已發行認足，d 賣方是註冊名義人也是受益人，代表百分之百的已發行且繳足股本。", "e 是重點：The Vendor intends to capitalize US dollars eighty-one million five hundred twenty-six thousand seven hundred ninety-three of its shareholders loan into ordinary shares of the Company by Completion Date. 也就是股東貸款資本化，債轉股。f 於完成日，這批股份就是 the Sale Shares 標的股份。g 雙方的買賣意思。", "請特別記住三組易混淆用語：authorized 授權資本、issued 已發行、paid-up 或 fully paid 繳足，三者不同。registered owner 註冊名義人與 beneficial owner 受益人，兩者都要確認。representations 表述與 warranties 保證，救濟方法不同。", "最後 NOW THEREFORE, in consideration of the mutual agreements, representations, warranties and subject to the conditions contained herein, the parties hereto hereby agree as follows. 而第一條就是 Definitions and Interpretation，定義及解釋。"], "saya": ["4c060996cb24", "1db2550fad55", "1d686c33c802", "fd81ca34b15f", "0a1904ea3bc2", "69f640f7ec38"]}, "3-2-1": {"tree": "【定義條款 Definition・骨架】\n├ ① 何時需要：篇幅長、內容複雜、專有名詞多的英文合約\n├ ② 擺哪裡：通常第一條或第一節；有些放最後一條或最後一節（避免文件頭重腳輕）\n├ ③ 辨識方式：經定義用語一律**開頭大寫**（Manufacturer／Product／Trademark／Accounts）\n│   └ 口訣：看到大寫就回頭查定義；找不到就往合約最後翻\n├ ④ 引導句三零件\n│   ├ 範圍 In this Agreement\n│   ├ 例外 unless the contract（實務多作 context）otherwise requires\n│   └ 效力 shall have the meaning set out against them\n├ ⑤ 範例（會計類，兩個定義互相引用）\n│   ├ (a) \"Accounts\" means the audited financial statement comprising\n│   │     the balance sheet ＋ the profit and loss account ＋ the cash flow statement\n│   │     of XYZ **as of the Accounting Date**\n│   └ (b) \"Accounting Date\" means **with respect to XYZ**, the date of such **Accounts**\n│         for the financial year **ended** 31 December 2012\n├ ⑥ 另兩種定義寫法\n│   ├ (c) \"Completion Date\" **shall have the meaning specified in Clause 5**（指向別條）\n│   └ (d) \"US$\" means the lawful currency of the United States of America（幣別必定義）\n├ ⑦ 讀法：先通讀定義條款 → 讀本文遇大寫字再回查（事半功倍）\n├ ⑧ 功能：清晰化、避免搬弄文字（Facility＝貸款，不是設施）、縮短本文、爭議時的評斷依據\n├ ⑨ 我國法：定義條款與其他條款效力相同，法院尊重當事人的定義\n│   └ ⚠ 訴訟要提中文譯本，**譯錯會對自己不利**\n├ ⑩ 不是每份合約都要定義條款（名詞不多可就地定義）\n├ ⑪ 句型差異\n│   ├ means ＝ 封閉式（窮盡列舉）\n│   ├ includes ＝ 開放式（例示；including without limitation）\n│   └ means and includes ＝ 先封閉再補充\n└ ⑫ 同條常見解釋規則（Interpretation）\n    ├ singular include the plural（單數包含複數）\n    ├ headings are for convenience only（標題不影響解釋）\n    └ statute as amended from time to time（法規含不時修正）", "quiz": [{"q": "Why are defined terms written with an initial capital letter throughout a contract?", "o": [["A", "to emphasize their commercial importance"], ["B", "to signal that the word bears the specific meaning given in the definitions clause"], ["C", "because they are proper nouns"], ["D", "to show they are governed by foreign law"]], "a": "(B) to signal that the word bears the specific meaning given in the definitions clause", "zh": "大寫是在提示該用語採定義條款所賦予之特定意義。", "e": "看到大寫字就不能用一般字義推測，必須回到定義條款確認範圍。書上以 Manufacturer 即代表 DEF Ltd. 公司為例。"}, {"q": "Where is the definitions clause usually found, according to the book?", "o": [["A", "always in the preamble, before WITNESSETH"], ["B", "usually the first clause or section, but sometimes the last, to avoid a top-heavy document"], ["C", "always as an appendix"], ["D", "always immediately before the signature page"]], "a": "(B) usually the first clause or section, but sometimes the last, to avoid a top-heavy document", "zh": "通常在第一條或第一節，但有些合約放在最後，以免整份文件頭重腳輕。", "e": "所以查不到定義時要記得**往後翻**。審約的習慣是先把定義條款整條讀完，再回頭讀義務條文。"}, {"q": "\"Accounts\" means the audited financial statement comprising the balance sheet, the profit and loss account and the cash flow statement … — the word **means** indicates that the definition is:", "o": [["A", "illustrative, so other documents may also be Accounts"], ["B", "exhaustive, limited to the documents listed"], ["C", "subject to the auditors' discretion"], ["D", "applicable only to the balance sheet"]], "a": "(B) exhaustive, limited to the documents listed", "zh": "means 表示封閉式、窮盡的定義，僅限所列文件。", "e": "means＝封閉式；若要留擴張空間要用 includes 或 including without limitation。一字之差，範圍差很多，是審約必查點。"}, {"q": "What is the relationship between the two definitions (a) and (b)?", "o": [["A", "they are independent of each other"], ["B", "each is defined by reference to the other, so the whole chain must be read together"], ["C", "(b) overrides (a)"], ["D", "(a) applies only to XYZ and (b) only to the Purchaser"]], "a": "(B) each is defined by reference to the other, so the whole chain must be read together", "zh": "兩個定義互相引用，必須整條鏈一起讀。", "e": "Accounts 要靠 Accounting Date 定出時點，Accounting Date 又要靠 Accounts 定出是哪一份報表，最後才收斂到 2012 年 12 月 31 日終止之會計年度。"}, {"q": "\"the financial year ended 31 December 2012\" — changing **ended** to **ending** would:", "o": [["A", "make no difference"], ["B", "refer to a financial year that has not yet closed"], ["C", "extend the definition to all financial years"], ["D", "make the definition void"]], "a": "(B) refer to a financial year that has not yet closed", "zh": "改成 ending 會變成指尚未結束的會計年度。", "e": "ended（過去分詞）＝已結束；ending（現在分詞）＝將結束、尚未結束。財務數字綁錯時點，價金調整與保證期間都會跟著錯。"}, {"q": "\"Completion Date\" shall have the meaning specified in Clause 5. This drafting technique means:", "o": [["A", "the term is undefined and left to the court"], ["B", "the definition is given elsewhere in the contract and must be read across"], ["C", "Clause 5 is incorporated into the definitions clause"], ["D", "the term only applies to Clause 5"]], "a": "(B) the definition is given elsewhere in the contract and must be read across", "zh": "定義寫在別條，必須跳過去一併閱讀。", "e": "定義條款有三種寫法：means（就地定義）、shall have the meaning specified in Clause X（指向別條）、以及引用其他已定義用語。審約時要把整條鏈讀完。"}, {"q": "According to the book, why is defining \"Facility\" as a loan in a financing agreement so important?", "o": [["A", "to shorten the contract"], ["B", "to stop a party later arguing that \"Facility\" means premises, equipment or a site"], ["C", "because the law requires it"], ["D", "to satisfy the auditors"]], "a": "(B) to stop a party later arguing that \"Facility\" means premises, equipment or a site", "zh": "為了避免一方「指鹿為馬」，把 Facility 解釋成配備、場地或設施。", "e": "書中用這個例子說明定義條款的核心功能：確定用語所指涉的範圍，**減少合約雙方搬弄文字的機會**，並在糾紛時作為公正評斷權利義務的依據。"}], "say": ["定義條款。於篇幅較長、內容複雜或專有名詞較多的英文合約，常常會設計一條或一節定義條款，規定本合約中使用的專有名詞的定義和解釋。", "位置通常在第一條或第一節，但有些合約會放在最後一條或最後一節，以避免整份文件頭重腳輕。所以查不到定義時記得往後翻。", "辨識方式很簡單：經定義的用語一律開頭大寫。口訣是，看到大寫就回頭查定義。", "引導句有三個固定零件：範圍 In this Agreement；例外 unless the contract otherwise requires，實務上更常見的寫法是 unless the context otherwise requires；效力 shall have the meaning set out against them。", "範例是會計類定義，而且兩個定義互相引用。Accounts means the audited financial statement comprising the balance sheet, the profit and loss account and the cash flow statement of XYZ as of the Accounting Date. 而 Accounting Date means with respect to XYZ, the date of such Accounts for the financial year ended thirty-first December, two thousand twelve.", "定義還有另外兩種寫法。Completion Date shall have the meaning specified in Clause 5，意義寫在別條，要跳過去讀。還有 US dollars means the lawful currency of the United States of America，跨境合約一定要定義幣別。", "第一次讀英文合約的正確順序是：先通讀一遍定義和解釋條款，不必強記，接下來讀主要條款時，凡遇到開頭字母大寫的專有名詞，再回頭索引定義，就會事半功倍。", "書中的經典例子：融資合約中的 Facility，經過定義係指貸款，那麼任何一方就沒有機會指鹿為馬，把它說成配備、場地或設施。這就是定義條款的核心功能。", "在我國法下，定義條款與其他合約條款效力相同，法院會尊重當事人的定義。但要特別注意，訴訟時法院會要求提出中文譯本，譯文如果沒有確實表達英文文義，反而會產生對自己不利的結果。", "最後記住句型差異：means 是封閉式的窮盡列舉，includes 是開放式的例示，means and includes 是先封閉再補充。一字之差，範圍差很多。"], "saya": ["06fa9b3bd84f", "d9a948e1429d", "b834664cb902", "4852aa8adfa5", "a4da41f96237", "2be395a16857", "c93d0b4ef675", "fa70c62fbfda", "2baf904a8dc8", "d03d9bb12e12"]}, "3-3-1": {"tree": "【適用優先順序條款 Preference・骨架】\n├ ① 問題：一筆交易不只一份文件，條款歧異時誰優先？\n├ ② 兩個高風險架構\n│   ├ ISDA 主合約系統：Master Agreement ＋ Schedule ＋ Confirmation\n│   └ 多當事人／多次發行：中期債券發行計畫（信託合約＋個別發行文件補充）\n├ ③ 範例的三層次序\n│   ├ 第1句 Schedule ＞ this Agreement\n│   │     In the event of any inconsistency … the Schedule shall prevail\n│   ├ 第2句 Managing Agreement §5 ＞ this Agreement\n│   │     notwithstanding any other provisions in this Agreement to the contrary（凌駕句）\n│   └ 第3句 其餘 this Agreement ＞ Managing Agreement\n│         in the event and **to the extent that**（限縮語，只在衝突範圍內）\n├ ④ 關鍵字\n│   ├ shall prevail ＝ 優先適用（不是「獲勝」）\n│   ├ notwithstanding … to the contrary ＝ 最強凌駕句\n│   └ to the extent that ＝ 只在那一塊優先\n└ ⑤ 我國法：司法實務尊重當事人約定的適用順序及優先性", "quiz": [{"q": "\"In the event of any inconsistency between this Agreement and any Schedule hereto, the Schedule shall prevail.\" This means:", "o": [["A", "the Schedule is void if it conflicts with the Agreement"], ["B", "the Schedule's terms are applied in preference to the Agreement's"], ["C", "the court decides which applies"], ["D", "both are applied equally"]], "a": "(B) the Schedule's terms are applied in preference to the Agreement's", "zh": "附件的條款優先於本合約適用。", "e": "prevail 在合約裡＝優先適用、以…為準，不是「獲勝」。同一個用法還有基準語言條款的 this English version shall govern。"}, {"q": "What is the effect of \"notwithstanding any other provisions in this Agreement to the contrary\"?", "o": [["A", "it limits the clause to non-conflicting situations"], ["B", "it overrides every other provision of the Agreement, even those saying the opposite"], ["C", "it makes the clause subject to the rest of the Agreement"], ["D", "it has no legal effect"]], "a": "(B) it overrides every other provision of the Agreement, even those saying the opposite", "zh": "它凌駕本合約所有其他條款，連相反文義的條款也蓋過去。", "e": "notwithstanding 是合約中最強的**凌駕句**。審約時看到它，要立刻回頭找出它蓋掉了哪些條款——這是最常被忽略的風險點。"}, {"q": "\"in the event and to the extent that there shall be an inconsistency\" — the words **to the extent that** mean the priority applies:", "o": [["A", "to the whole of the Managing Agreement"], ["B", "only so far as the two documents actually conflict"], ["C", "only if both parties agree"], ["D", "only after Completion"]], "a": "(B) only so far as the two documents actually conflict", "zh": "只在兩份文件真正衝突的範圍內優先。", "e": "to the extent that 是**限縮語**，不衝突的部分兩份文件仍各自有效，不會整份被取代。和 notwithstanding（擴張、凌駕）剛好相反。"}, {"q": "Under the sample clause, which document ranks highest overall?", "o": [["A", "this Agreement"], ["B", "the Managing Agreement"], ["C", "the Schedule"], ["D", "they rank equally"]], "a": "(C) the Schedule", "zh": "附件最優先。", "e": "次序是：附件 ＞ 本合約；管理協議第 5 條 ＞ 本合約；其餘情形本合約 ＞ 管理協議。書中說「附件的條款具有最優先性」。"}, {"q": "Which contract architecture most urgently needs an order-of-precedence clause?", "o": [["A", "a one-page purchase order"], ["B", "an ISDA master agreement with schedules and confirmations"], ["C", "a simple NDA"], ["D", "an employment contract"]], "a": "(B) an ISDA master agreement with schedules and confirmations", "zh": "ISDA 主合約＋附件＋確認書的多層架構最需要。", "e": "文件層次越多、當事人越多（例如中期債券發行計畫每次發行都補充文件），條款衝突的機率越高，優先順序條款就越必要。"}], "say": ["適用優先順序條款。問題意識很簡單：一筆交易常常不只一份合約文件，不同文件的條款如果有歧異，就會有適用優先順序的問題。", "兩個高風險架構要記住。第一是 ISDA 主合約系統，設計為主合約、附件及確認書三層。第二是涉及多數當事人的架構，例如債券發行，中期債券發行計畫中的信託合約會在每次發行後繼續以其他文件加以補充。", "範例條款建立了三層次序。第一句：In the event of any inconsistency between this Agreement and any Schedule hereto, the Schedule shall prevail. 附件優先。", "第二句：Sections 5 of the Managing Agreement shall prevail over any inconsistent or conflicting provisions in this Agreement, notwithstanding any other provisions in this Agreement to the contrary. 管理協議第五條最優先。", "第三句：Other than Section 5 of the Managing Agreement, in the event and to the extent that there shall be an inconsistency, this Agreement shall prevail. 其餘情形本合約優先。", "三個關鍵用語：shall prevail 是優先適用，不是獲勝。notwithstanding … to the contrary 是最強的凌駕句。to the extent that 是限縮語，只在衝突的範圍內優先。", "最後，合約效力適用優先順序條款的效力，於我國司法實務上會受到尊重及承認，法院會依當事人的約定決定條款適用的順序及優先性。"], "saya": ["e76da243d22f", "5bc5845cea63", "8564ed729514", "7a2010945dae", "b75f081a9074", "d902e0378e50", "3527815115a5"]}, "3-3-2": {"tree": "【完整合約條款 Entire Agreement・骨架】\n├ ① 功能\n│   ├ 確認「這一份」就是當事人間完整的合約\n│   └ 附件、附表與本文同屬一份合約（生效、終止、失效、執行都依同一份）\n├ ② 條款的兩個動作\n│   ├ contains the entire agreement（本約即全部）\n│   └ supersedes all prior agreements, arrangements and letters of intent\n│       no matter they are made **in writing and orally**（書面＋口頭都掃）\n├ ③ 目的：權利義務完全以最終合約文件為準，避免將來法律糾紛\n├ ④ 我國法效果\n│   ├ 會發生當事人約定的效果 → 先前協議除有保留外皆不再生效力\n│   └ ⚠ 但**不影響**依民法得撤銷合約之權利（詐欺、脅迫）\n└ ⑤ 審約必加的兩個限縮／保留\n    ├ with respect to the subject matter hereof（只掃這筆交易）\n    └ save as expressly provided herein（保留 LOI 中仍有效的保密／排他條款）", "quiz": [{"q": "\"This Contract … supersedes all prior agreements, arrangements and letters of intent…\" The verb **supersedes** means the prior documents:", "o": [["A", "rank below this Contract but remain in force"], ["B", "cease to have effect"], ["C", "are incorporated into this Contract"], ["D", "must be re-signed"]], "a": "(B) cease to have effect", "zh": "先前文件失其效力。", "e": "supersede＝取代使之失效；prevail 只是衝突時優先適用，先前文件仍然存在。這組對比是審約的基本功。"}, {"q": "Why do the words \"no matter they are made in writing and orally\" matter?", "o": [["A", "they extend the clause to oral promises made during negotiation"], ["B", "they require all agreements to be in writing"], ["C", "they limit the clause to written documents"], ["D", "they relate to the governing language"]], "a": "(A) they extend the clause to oral promises made during negotiation", "zh": "把談判中的口頭承諾也一併取代掉。", "e": "談判過程中的口頭保證最難舉證也最容易生糾紛，把 oral 寫進去正是這個條款最實用的一半。"}, {"q": "According to the book, an entire agreement clause under Taiwanese law does NOT affect:", "o": [["A", "prior written agreements"], ["B", "prior oral understandings"], ["C", "the right to rescind the contract for fraud or duress"], ["D", "the schedules to the contract"]], "a": "(C) the right to rescind the contract for fraud or duress", "zh": "不影響因詐欺或脅迫而撤銷合約的權利。", "e": "書中明言：完整合約條款會發生當事人約定的效果，但並不會影響合約當事人依我國民法得行使之可得撤銷合約的權利。它掃得掉「協議」，掃不掉「詐欺」。"}, {"q": "A letter of intent contains binding confidentiality and exclusivity clauses. A plain entire agreement clause in the final contract risks:", "o": [["A", "nothing, LOIs are never binding"], ["B", "wiping out those still-useful binding clauses as well"], ["C", "making the LOI prevail over the contract"], ["D", "extending the LOI indefinitely"]], "a": "(B) wiping out those still-useful binding clauses as well", "zh": "可能連意向書中仍然有用的保密與排他條款一起掃掉。", "e": "所以要加保留語 save as expressly provided herein（除本合約另有明文規定外），把要留下的條款 carve out 出來。"}, {"q": "Which added phrase stops the clause from accidentally terminating the parties' unrelated existing contracts?", "o": [["A", "notwithstanding anything to the contrary"], ["B", "with respect to the subject matter hereof"], ["C", "time is of the essence"], ["D", "for the avoidance of doubt"]], "a": "(B) with respect to the subject matter hereof", "zh": "「就本合約標的事項而言」把取代範圍限縮在這筆交易。", "e": "少了這一句，條款字面上會掃掉雙方之間**所有**先前協議，包括不相干的既有保密協議或代理合約。這是實務上最常見的補救語。"}], "say": ["完整合約條款。所謂完整合約條款，entire agreement clause，或稱 whole agreement clause，係在確認和強調一份合約中涉及和包含的所有部分，為同一份完整的合約。", "特別是對於包含諸多附件或附表的合約，附件與附表都與本文歸屬於同一份合約，其生效、終止、失效和執行都必須依同一份合約中約定的內容。", "範例條款：This Contract contains the entire agreement of the parties and supersedes all prior agreements, arrangements and letters of intent between the parties, no matter they are made in writing and orally.", "它做兩件事：第一，宣告本約就是全部；第二，把先前的協議、安排與意向書全部取代掉，而且書面與口頭都算。", "請分清楚兩個動詞：supersede 是取代、使先前文件失效；prevail 只是衝突時優先適用，先前文件仍然存在。", "在我國法下，完整合約條款會發生當事人所約定的效果，先前以口頭或書面達成的任何協議，除非條款中有所保留，否則皆不再生效力。", "但是請記住書上的但書：這並不會影響合約當事人依我國民法得行使之可得撤銷合約的權利，例如因詐欺或脅迫而撤銷。它掃得掉協議，掃不掉詐欺。"], "saya": ["60f4aa855066", "2dc6169b051c", "63edb8e154ff", "f741a66162f5", "ededc179926a", "533f0f20f92d", "abdca140da2a"]}, "3-4-1": {"tree": "【約因與價金 Consideration & Purchase Price・骨架】\n├ ① 本節總說：確定合約在法律上有效可被執行\n│   ├ 外部因素：詐欺、錯誤、脅迫 → 得撤銷\n│   ├ 未經授權人簽名 → 不生效力\n│   └ 當事人可自訂：生效／失效條件、一部失效效果、完整性、約因、期間\n├ ② 約因（consideration）的本質\n│   ├ 英美法特有，決定能否請求法院**強制執行**\n│   ├ 二要素：bargain for（交易磋商）＋ legal detriment（法律上權益受損）\n│   ├ 歷史目的：排除**贈與合約**\n│   └ 大陸法系（含我國）無此概念\n├ ③ 呈現方式有二：單純陳述表明約因／訂定單獨的約因條款\n├ ④ 例一 約因作為價金（股權買賣）\n│   ├ Cl.1 \\\"Consideration\\\" means the consideration for the Sale Shares following adjustment as set out in Clause 4\n│   ├ Cl.4.1 Subject to adjustment … shall be NTD 400,000,000\n│   └ Cl.4.3 final Consideration ＝ 4.2(a)＋4.2(b)＋期間損益（management accounts as at Completion Date）\n├ ⑤ 例二 約因之陳述（兩種標準句）\n│   ├ in consideration of the **mutual covenants** herein contained\n│   └ in consideration of the mutual agreements, **representations, warranties** and subject to the conditions\n│   └ ★ 準據法為我國法時 → 視為**價金或主要給付義務條款**，不必執著英美法概念\n└ ⑥ 例三 價金約定\n    ├ The total purchase price … shall be US$250,000 **FOB Liverpool**\n    └ FOB＝賣方負擔至貨物上船之一刻；另有 CIF、CFR 等國貿條款", "quiz": [{"q": "Under Anglo-American law, the doctrine of consideration mainly exists to:", "o": [["A", "ensure contracts are in writing"], ["B", "exclude gratuitous promises (gifts) from being enforceable"], ["C", "fix the purchase price"], ["D", "protect consumers"]], "a": "(B) exclude gratuitous promises (gifts) from being enforceable", "zh": "主要在排除贈與合約的強制執行。", "e": "約因須經 bargain for（交易磋商）與 legal detriment（法律上權益受損）；英美法認為這樣的合意是慎思熟慮而達成，法院才強制執行。此概念不存在於大陸法系。"}, {"q": "The contract's governing law is Taiwanese law. How should a Taiwanese reader treat the \"consideration\" clause, according to the book?", "o": [["A", "ignore it as meaningless"], ["B", "treat it as the clause setting the price or the principal performance obligation"], ["C", "translate it as \"consideration\" and apply English case law"], ["D", "delete it, as it is invalid"]], "a": "(B) treat it as the clause setting the price or the principal performance obligation", "zh": "視為合約的價金或主要給付義務的條款。", "e": "書中明言：我國法下並沒有「約因」的概念，可將約因條款視為價金或主要給付義務的條款，不必執著於英美法下的概念，這也符合約因概念的原意。"}, {"q": "\"Subject to adjustment pursuant to clause 4.2 below, the Consideration … shall be NTD 400,000,000.\" This tells you that NTD 400,000,000 is:", "o": [["A", "the final, fixed price"], ["B", "a base figure that will be recalculated"], ["C", "a deposit"], ["D", "a penalty"]], "a": "(B) a base figure that will be recalculated", "zh": "只是基準金額，之後還會調整。", "e": "Subject to＝以…為前提、受…拘束。第 4.3 條把簽約日到完成日之間反映在 management accounts 的損益也加進去，這就是股權交易的價金調整機制。"}, {"q": "\"management accounts as at Completion Date\" differ from audited accounts because they are:", "o": [["A", "prepared by the buyer"], ["B", "internal and not audited"], ["C", "prepared under IFRS only"], ["D", "公開揭露的"]], "a": "(B) internal and not audited", "zh": "是未經查核的內部管理帳。", "e": "價金若綁在未經查核的管理帳上，必須另外約定編製基礎、會計政策一致性與爭議解決方式（例如 expert determination），否則交割後最常吵的就是這一塊。"}, {"q": "\"US$250,000 FOB Liverpool\" means the seller's price covers costs up to:", "o": [["A", "delivery at the buyer's warehouse"], ["B", "the moment the goods are loaded on board at Liverpool"], ["C", "the goods leaving the seller's factory"], ["D", "freight and insurance to the destination"]], "a": "(B) the moment the goods are loaded on board at Liverpool", "zh": "賣方負擔至貨物在利物浦港上船之一刻為止。", "e": "FOB＝Free On Board。若改成 CFR 要加運費、CIF 還要加保險，報價內容會隨國貿條款而不同。報價不寫 Incoterm 等於沒報完。"}], "say": ["約因與價金。一份合約最重要之處，除了主要交易條款之外，即為確定這份合約在法律上有效且可以被執行。", "約因，consideration，是英美合約法中特別的法律概念，對合約本身是否可以請求法院強制執行扮演關鍵角色。它類似中文的對價：一方所為的承諾，必須有另一方提供相對的承諾或行為。", "約因有兩個要素：bargain for，交易磋商的過程；以及 legal detriment，相對人法律上權益受損。約因的概念主要在排除贈與合約，類似的觀念並不存在於大陸法系的國家，包括我國法。", "例一，約因作為價金。Consideration means the consideration for the Sale Shares following adjustment as set out in Clause 4. 而第四點一條：Subject to adjustment pursuant to clause 4.2 below, the Consideration for the sale and purchase of Sale Shares shall be NTD four hundred million. 請注意 subject to adjustment，四億元只是基準，真正的價金要等交割日的管理帳算完。", "例二，約因之陳述。標準句是 Now, in consideration of the mutual covenants herein contained, the parties hereby agree as follows. 另一種寫法加上 representations 與 warranties。", "這裡有一句給我國讀者最實用的話：在我國法下並沒有約因的概念，因此英文合約中的約因條款，於準據法為我國法時，可將之視為合約的價金或主要給付義務的條款，不必執著於英美法下約因的概念。", "例三，價金約定。The total purchase price to be paid by Buyer to Seller for the Equipment described herein shall be US dollars two hundred fifty thousand, FOB Liverpool. FOB 是國貿條款，賣方的報價由其負擔至貨物上船之一刻為止，當事人也可以約定 CIF 或 CFR 等其他條款。"], "saya": ["ff49c76561d0", "d3451b2e797f", "31e9e150ae4a", "dacbd24c3f28", "71d5b3be3f7f", "35c2125478cc", "7f8e48c99a30"]}, "3-4-2": {"tree": "【停止條件 Condition Precedent・骨架】\n├ ① 定義：約定某條件發生後，某項權利義務乃至合約本身才生效\n├ ② 與表述條款（representations）之別\n│   ├ 停止條件 → **尚未出現**但應當出現的事實或事件（未來）\n│   └ 表述條款 → **業已存在**的事實或事件（過去／現在）\n├ ③ 典型例子：政府管制貨品貿易的 quota（配額）、license（許可證）\n│   └ 沒有配額或許可證 → 貿易變成非法走私，合約關係無從談起\n├ ④ ⚠ condition 的三種意義（讀合約必須分辨）\n│   ├ ㈠ 單純指合約條款（terms and conditions）→ 與生效失效無關\n│   ├ ㈡ 指「重要條款」→ 違反時未違約方得 terminate；相對詞 warranty\n│   └ ㈢ 指使合約生效或失效的條件 → condition precedent／condition subsequent\n├ ⑤ 範例三句\n│   ├ The obligation … **is subject to** Purchaser obtaining the Approval from government authority\n│   ├ Vendor may terminate **at its sole discretion** if Purchaser fails to obtain the Approval\n│   │   on or prior to [date] (\\\"**Long Stop Date**\\\")\n│   └ Parties may agree to extend … (\\\"New Completion Date\\\")\n└ ⑥ 我國法：民法§99Ⅰ 附停止條件之法律行為，於條件成就時發生效力\n    （§99Ⅱ 解除條件成就時失其效力；§99Ⅲ 得以特約另定效果發生時點）", "quiz": [{"q": "What distinguishes a condition precedent from a representation?", "o": [["A", "a condition precedent concerns facts that already exist"], ["B", "a condition precedent concerns an event that has not yet occurred but should"], ["C", "they are the same thing"], ["D", "a representation always triggers termination"]], "a": "(B) a condition precedent concerns an event that has not yet occurred but should", "zh": "停止條件針對的是尚未出現但應當出現的事實或事件。", "e": "表述條款（representations）表述的是**業已存在**的事實；停止條件指向**未來**。這是書中明確點出的區別，也是審約的第一個分辨點。"}, {"q": "In the phrase \"terms and conditions\", the word **condition** means:", "o": [["A", "a condition precedent"], ["B", "simply a contractual provision"], ["C", "an important term whose breach allows termination"], ["D", "a condition subsequent"]], "a": "(B) simply a contractual provision", "zh": "單純指合約條款。", "e": "書中強調 condition 在英美法下至少有三種意義：㈠單純的合約條款㈡重要條款（違反得終止，相對詞 warranty）㈢使合約生效或失效的條件。**不是每個 condition 都是停止條件**。"}, {"q": "Breach of a term classified as a **condition** (second meaning) gives the innocent party:", "o": [["A", "only damages"], ["B", "the right to terminate the contract"], ["C", "no remedy"], ["D", "the right to rescind for misrepresentation"]], "a": "(B) the right to terminate the contract", "zh": "取得終止合約的權利。", "e": "condition（重要條款）違反 → 得終止；warranty（非重要條款）違反 → 原則上只能請求損害賠償。這組對比在表述與保證那一節還會再出現。"}, {"q": "What is the function of the \"Long Stop Date\"?", "o": [["A", "the date the contract is signed"], ["B", "the latest date by which the condition must be satisfied, failing which a party may terminate"], ["C", "the date payment is due"], ["D", "the date the warranties expire"]], "a": "(B) the latest date by which the condition must be satisfied, failing which a party may terminate", "zh": "條件最晚要成就的日子，屆期未成就一方得終止。", "e": "沒有 Long Stop Date，合約就會無限期懸著。範例中賣方得 at its sole discretion 終止，但雙方也可以合意延長為 New Completion Date。"}, {"q": "Which Taiwanese provision corresponds to a condition precedent?", "o": [["A", "民法第 98 條（解釋合約應探求當事人真意）"], ["B", "民法第 99 條第 1 項（附停止條件之法律行為，於條件成就時發生效力）"], ["C", "民法第 111 條（一部無效）"], ["D", "民法第 247 條之 1（定型化契約）"]], "a": "(B) 民法第 99 條第 1 項", "zh": "附停止條件之法律行為，於條件成就時，發生效力。", "e": "民法§99：Ⅰ停止條件成就時發生效力；Ⅱ解除條件成就時失其效力；Ⅲ當事人得以特約使效果不於條件成就時發生。英文合約的 condition precedent 完全符合這條。"}], "say": ["停止條件，condition precedent，或稱先決條件。合約雙方預設交易生效需要出現的前提條件，約定只有在此條件發生後，合約中的某一項權利義務關係，乃至合約本身才可以生效。", "請分清楚停止條件與表述條款。停止條件針對的是尚未出現、但應當出現的事實或事件；表述條款則是表述業已存在的事實或事件。", "典型的停止條件，例如涉及政府管制貨品貿易時，取得足夠的配額 quota，或者必須持有許可證 license。沒有配額或許可證，貿易就變成非法的走私，合約關係無從談起。", "最重要的觀念：condition 這個字在英美合約法下至少有三種意義。第一，單純指合約條款，例如 terms and conditions。第二，指重要的合約條款，違反時未違約的一方享有終止合約的權利，其相對詞是 warranty。第三，才是指使合約生效或失效的條件，也就是停止條件與解除條件。讀合約時要仔細判斷。", "範例條款：The obligation of the parties under this Contract is subject to Purchaser obtaining the Approval from government authority. Vendor may terminate this Agreement at its sole discretion if Purchaser fails to obtain the Approval on or prior to the Long Stop Date.", "Long Stop Date 最後期限日是跨境交易的靈魂零件。審約要確認三件事：誰負責取得核准、要盡到什麼程度的努力、以及期限到了的後果。", "我國法對照，民法第九十九條第一項規定：附停止條件之法律行為，於條件成就時，發生效力。英文合約的 condition precedent 完全符合這條規定。"], "saya": ["8c6be45be655", "4e99e8cbe885", "14c1e8f9b55e", "e2221bb629d4", "c039a3651321", "078643dfc794", "f84cce098cdd"]}, "3-4-3": {"tree": "【解除條件 Condition Subsequent・骨架】\n├ ① 定義：約定事件發生時，合約或合約所訂義務**失其效力**\n│   └ 效果與停止條件**剛好相反**（停止＝開；解除＝關）\n├ ② 範例：以董事會決議證書為解除條件\n│   ├ This Agreement shall become **automatically void and of no force and effect**\n│   │   if on or prior to June 13, 2012 Lender shall not have received a certificate…\n│   ├ (a) true, complete and correct copy of the **resolutions of the Board of Directors**\n│   │     authorizing the **execution, delivery and performance** of this Agreement\n│   └ (b) such resolutions have not been **amended, modified, revoked or rescinded**\n├ ③ 與停止條件的差異（書中特別點出）\n│   ├ 停止條件：設定為合約**生效的前提要件**\n│   └ 本例：合約先有效，貸款人未於期限前提出證書 → **自動失效**\n└ ④ 我國法：民法§99Ⅱ 附解除條件之法律行為，於條件成就時，失其效力", "quiz": [{"q": "A condition subsequent, when satisfied, causes the contract to:", "o": [["A", "come into effect"], ["B", "cease to have effect"], ["C", "be extended"], ["D", "be assigned"]], "a": "(B) cease to have effect", "zh": "失其效力。", "e": "停止條件成就才生效（民法§99Ⅰ）；解除條件成就則失效（民法§99Ⅱ）。效果剛好相反。"}, {"q": "\"This Agreement shall become automatically void\" is riskier for a party than \"a party may terminate\" because:", "o": [["A", "it requires notice"], ["B", "no notice or election is needed — the contract dies by itself"], ["C", "it needs court approval"], ["D", "it only applies to the lender"]], "a": "(B) no notice or election is needed — the contract dies by itself", "zh": "不必通知、不必主張，合約自己失效。", "e": "automatically void 剝奪了「要不要繼續」的選擇權。想保留彈性時，談判上會爭取改成 may terminate（得終止）。"}, {"q": "What must the certificate attach, under limb (a)?", "o": [["A", "the company's financial statements"], ["B", "a true, complete and correct copy of the board resolutions authorizing execution, delivery and performance"], ["C", "the shareholders' register"], ["D", "the articles of association"]], "a": "(B) a true, complete and correct copy of the board resolutions authorizing execution, delivery and performance", "zh": "附上授權執行、交付及履行本合約之董事會決議的真實、完整且正確副本。", "e": "execution, delivery and performance 是英美合約的授權三部曲，授權決議三者都要寫到，否則可能被質疑授權不足。"}, {"q": "Limb (b) requires the resolutions not to have been \"amended, modified, revoked or rescinded\". The purpose is to ensure:", "o": [["A", "the resolutions are recent"], ["B", "the authority relied on is still alive at the relevant date"], ["C", "the board has met"], ["D", "the company is solvent"]], "a": "(B) the authority relied on is still alive at the relevant date", "zh": "確保所依賴的授權到該時點仍然有效存在。", "e": "決議通過了之後還可能被修訂或撤回，所以要證明「自決議日起至今」未經變動。四個動詞把動手腳的各種可能都蓋住。"}, {"q": "The book notes that this clause differs from a condition precedent because:", "o": [["A", "it is not a condition at all"], ["B", "it is not set as a prerequisite to the contract taking effect, but makes the contract lapse if the certificate is not produced in time"], ["C", "it only binds the borrower"], ["D", "it requires government approval"]], "a": "(B) it is not set as a prerequisite to the contract taking effect, but makes the contract lapse if the certificate is not produced in time", "zh": "不是設定為合約生效的前提要件，而是未如期提出證書則合約自動失效。", "e": "同一件事可以寫成停止條件或解除條件，差別在**過渡期間合約有沒有效**。解除條件下合約先生效，拿不到才倒回去。"}], "say": ["解除條件，condition subsequent，係指雙方當事人約定的事件發生時，合約或合約所訂的義務將失其效力，當事人可以不再繼續依合約履行。解除條件的效果，剛好和停止條件相反。", "一句話記住：停止條件是條件成就才生效，開關打開；解除條件是條件成就就失效，開關關掉。", "範例條款：This Agreement shall become automatically void and of no force and effect if on or prior to June thirteenth, two thousand twelve, Lender shall not have received a certificate from the Secretary of K Corp. certifying that (a) attached to each such certificate is a true, complete and correct copy of the resolutions of the Board of Directors authorizing the execution, delivery and performance of this Agreement, and (b) such resolutions have not been amended, modified, revoked or rescinded.", "書中特別點出，與前面的停止條件不同的是，這個條件並不是設定為合約生效的前提要件，而是設定為貸款人必須在指定期限前提出證書證明有效董事會決議的存在，否則合約就會自動失效。", "請注意 automatically void，自動失效，不必通知也不必主張。想保留彈性時，談判上會爭取改成 may terminate，得終止。", "我國法對照，民法第九十九條第二項：附解除條件之法律行為，於條件成就時，失其效力。本例的條款符合這條規定。"], "saya": ["dd11fea68212", "e35a5df02bdf", "a27f534f3aad", "c44525e04f8c", "b38e0b5375d2", "4bc65b760b3e"]}, "3-4-4": {"tree": "【效力保留 Survivorship ＋ 合約可分性 Severability・骨架】\n├ ㈣效力保留條款（管**時間**：合約死了，誰還活著）\n│   ├ 目的：確認此等條款的效力不受合約本身失效而受影響\n│   ├ 典型：違約的追索與救濟（債務追索、損害賠償、法律救濟）、保密條款之執行\n│   ├ 範例 Sections 5(a), 5(c), 6, 7, 12, 14, 16, 18 and 20 to 33 hereof\n│   │      shall **survive the expiration or termination** of this Agreement\n│   │      and shall continue for so long as stated therein\n│   ├ 常見保留清單：會計事項、智慧財產權、保密義務、陳述、補償、\n│   │               合約可分性、仲裁條款、準據法\n│   └ ⚠ expiration（期滿）與 termination（終止）兩個都要寫\n└ ㈤合約可分性條款（管**空間**：一條壞了，其他還算不算）\n    ├ 目的：增加合約靈活性；一部失效時其他條款繼續生效\n    ├ 寫法一 若被 a court of competent jurisdiction 認定\n    │        illegal, invalid or unenforceable\n    │        → deemed stricken and deleted **as if never incorporated herein**\n    │        → 其餘條款 continue in full force and effect\n    ├ 寫法二 其餘條款之 validity, legality and enforceability\n    │        shall not in any way be affected or impaired\n    └ 我國法：民法§111 一部無效者全部無效，**但除去該部分亦可成立者，其他部分仍為有效**", "quiz": [{"q": "Which clause ensures that confidentiality obligations continue after the contract ends?", "o": [["A", "severability"], ["B", "survivorship"], ["C", "entire agreement"], ["D", "counterpart"]], "a": "(B) survivorship", "zh": "效力保留條款。", "e": "效力保留管的是**時間**：合約終止後哪些條款還活著。書中舉的典型就是違約的追索與救濟條款，以及保密條款之執行。"}, {"q": "Why must a survival clause mention both \"expiration\" and \"termination\"?", "o": [["A", "they are synonyms, for emphasis"], ["B", "expiration is the natural end of the term, termination is an early ending — both must be covered"], ["C", "expiration applies to schedules only"], ["D", "termination requires court approval"]], "a": "(B) expiration is the natural end of the term, termination is an early ending — both must be covered", "zh": "期間屆滿與提前終止是兩回事，兩個都要寫。", "e": "只寫 termination，合約自然到期時保密義務就可能掉了；這是實務上很常見的漏洞。"}, {"q": "\"such provision shall be deemed stricken and deleted … as if never incorporated herein\" means the invalid clause is treated as:", "o": [["A", "valid until a court rules"], ["B", "having never been part of the contract"], ["C", "suspended until the law changes"], ["D", "replaced by statute"]], "a": "(B) having never been part of the contract", "zh": "視為從未被納入過。", "e": "效果拉回到最初，不是只往後失效。deem＝視為（法律擬制），合約中極高頻。"}, {"q": "Which Taiwanese provision does the severability clause correspond to?", "o": [["A", "民法第 98 條"], ["B", "民法第 99 條"], ["C", "民法第 111 條"], ["D", "民法第 247 條之 1"]], "a": "(C) 民法第 111 條", "zh": "法律行為之一部分無效者，全部皆為無效；但除去該部分亦可成立者，則其他部分仍為有效。", "e": "我國法的原則是「一部無效、全部無效」，但書才是可分。所以合約可分性條款等於當事人**事先表明意思**：請切掉壞掉那條就好。"}, {"q": "\"illegal, invalid or unenforceable\" — the word **unenforceable** describes a provision that is:", "o": [["A", "contrary to law"], ["B", "void from the outset"], ["C", "valid but which a court will not enforce"], ["D", "not yet in force"]], "a": "(C) valid but which a court will not enforce", "zh": "有效但法院不予強制執行。", "e": "三個層次不同：illegal（違法）、invalid（無效）、unenforceable（有效但不可執行，例如逾時效或違反形式要件）。三個都要寫才周延。"}], "say": ["這一單元有兩個條款。先看效力保留條款，survivorship。於合約依雙方約定終止或失效時，合約中某些條款可以約定並不隨合約失效而終止其效力。效力保留條款的目的，是確認此等條款的效力不受合約本身失效而受影響。", "最典型可以適用效力保留的，是各種對違約行為的追索和救濟條款，如債務的追索、損害的賠償及法律救濟等，以及保密條款之執行。", "範例：Sections 5(a), 5(c), 6, 7, 12, 14, 16, 18 and 20 to 33 hereof shall survive the expiration or termination of this Agreement and shall continue for so long as stated therein. 請注意 expiration 期滿與 termination 終止兩個都要寫。", "接著是合約可分性條款，severability。它存在的目的是增加合約的靈活性，規定合約中某些權利義務關係因某些事件失效時，其他權利義務關係是否可以繼續生效。", "寫法一：If any provision of this Agreement shall be construed by a court of competent jurisdiction to be illegal, invalid or unenforceable, such provision shall be deemed stricken and deleted from this Agreement as if never incorporated herein, but all other provisions shall continue in full force and effect.", "寫法二比較簡潔：the validity, legality and enforceability of the remaining provisions shall not in any way be affected or impaired.", "我國法對照，民法第一百十一條：法律行為之一部分無效者，全部皆為無效；但除去該部分亦可成立者，則其他部分仍為有效。注意原則是一部無效全部無效，但書才是可分，所以合約可分性條款在我國法下很有用。", "最後記住分工：效力保留管時間，合約死了誰還活著；合約可分性管空間，一條壞了其他還算不算數。"], "saya": ["691c528cd81a", "335398139b60", "a3259255c233", "b14861ff7beb", "dde8a93143df", "159b486cb789", "c3021416010c", "c36064dbb140"]}, "3-4-5": {"tree": "【期間及續約 Term and Renewal・骨架】\n├ ① 期間條款管三件事：何時到期、如何認定到期、到期如何延長\n├ ② 合約到期的三種型態\n│   ├ ㈠法定期限（法律規定某些合約不得超過一定年限）\n│   ├ ㈡約定期限（雙方自行議訂）\n│   └ ㈢無期限合約 ＋ 終止條款（terminations）規定何種情形可終止\n├ ③ 範例 (a) 期間\n│   └ for one (1) year **commencing on** 1 Aug 2012 **and terminating on** 31 Jul 2013 (the \\\"Term\\\"),\n│     unless otherwise terminated pursuant to this Agreement\n├ ④ 範例 (b) 自動展延（evergreen）\n│   ├ Unless terminated or unless either party has given **at least ninety (90) days written notice**\n│   │   of its intention to terminate **prior to expiration**\n│   └ then the Term shall **automatically be extended from month to month**\n│   └ 三個關鍵數字：展延單位／通知期間／通知方式\n└ ⑤ 我國法\n    ├ 民法§102Ⅰ 附始期之法律行為，於期限屆至時發生效力\n    ├ 民法§102Ⅱ 附終期之法律行為，於期限屆滿時失其效力\n    ├ 簽字日≠生效日，但除非特別約定通常自簽約日生效（as of the date hereof）\n    └ 民法未規定「展延」，但法院尊重當事人的自動展延約定", "quiz": [{"q": "Under the sample clause, what must a party do to stop the agreement rolling on?", "o": [["A", "nothing; it ends automatically on 31 July 2013"], ["B", "give the other party at least 90 days' written notice before expiration"], ["C", "obtain the other party's consent"], ["D", "apply to court"]], "a": "(B) give the other party at least 90 days' written notice before expiration", "zh": "於期間屆滿前至少九十日以書面通知他方。", "e": "這就是 evergreen（長青）條款的陷阱：**什麼都不做反而會被自動綁下一期**，而且本例是按月展延。"}, {"q": "\"the Term shall automatically be extended from month to month\" means each extension lasts:", "o": [["A", "one year"], ["B", "one month"], ["C", "until terminated by court"], ["D", "indefinitely with no exit"]], "a": "(B) one month", "zh": "每次展延一個月。", "e": "展延單位決定你下次能退出的時間點。若寫 from year to year，錯過通知就要再等一年。"}, {"q": "Which is NOT one of the three ways a contract comes to an end, per the book?", "o": [["A", "a statutory maximum term"], ["B", "a term agreed by the parties"], ["C", "no fixed term, but with a termination clause"], ["D", "unilateral revocation at any time without any clause"]], "a": "(D) unilateral revocation at any time without any clause", "zh": "沒有任何條款依據就片面撤回，不是書中所列的型態。", "e": "書中列舉：㈠法定的合約期限㈡雙方約定的期限㈢無期限合約但加入合約終止條款（terminations）。"}, {"q": "\"附終期之法律行為，於期限屆滿時，失其效力\" corresponds to:", "o": [["A", "民法第 99 條"], ["B", "民法第 102 條第 2 項"], ["C", "民法第 111 條"], ["D", "民法第 98 條"]], "a": "(B) 民法第 102 條第 2 項", "zh": "附終期之法律行為，於期限屆滿時，失其效力。", "e": "§102Ⅰ 附始期→期限屆至發生效力；§102Ⅱ 附終期→期限屆滿失其效力。與§99（條件）成對記：條件管「會不會發生」，期限管「什麼時候」。"}, {"q": "According to the book, the signing date of a contract:", "o": [["A", "is always the effective date"], ["B", "is never the effective date"], ["C", "is not necessarily the effective date, but absent special agreement the contract usually takes effect from signing"], ["D", "must be approved by the court"]], "a": "(C) is not necessarily the effective date, but absent special agreement the contract usually takes effect from signing", "zh": "簽字日不必然為生效日，惟除非特別約定，通常自簽約日生效。", "e": "要另訂生效日就寫清楚，例如 with effect from…；否則就是 as of the date hereof。"}], "say": ["期間及續約條款。合約的期間條款規定了合約於何時到期、如何認定合約的到期，以及在合約到期時如何延長合約的期間。", "合約會因為三種情況到期。第一是法定的合約期限，由適用的法律規定某些合約不得超過一定的年限。第二是雙方約定的期限。第三是無期限合約，但雙方可以加入合約終止條款，規定在何種情形下合約可以終止。", "範例 a 項：The term of this Agreement shall be for one year commencing on the first day of August two thousand twelve and terminating on the thirty-first day of July two thousand thirteen, the Term, unless otherwise terminated pursuant to this Agreement.", "範例 b 項是自動展延：Unless terminated or unless either party has given the other at least ninety days written notice of its intention to terminate the Agreement prior to expiration, then the Term shall automatically be extended from month to month after its expiration.", "自動展延條款俗稱長青條款，evergreen clause。三個關鍵數字要一起看：展延單位是按月還是按年、通知期間幾天、以及通知方式是不是書面。少看一個就會被自動綁下一期。", "我國法對照，民法第一百零二條第一項：附始期之法律行為，於期限屆至時，發生效力。第二項：附終期之法律行為，於期限屆滿時，失其效力。", "另外請記住，合約的簽字日不必然為合約的生效日，但除非有特別約定，合約通常自簽約日生效，英文寫作 as of the date hereof。我國民法雖然沒有針對展延的特別規定，不過法院原則上會尊重當事人自動展延的約定。"], "saya": ["c9302762792f", "c968932deae3", "7a6f16e73ce2", "f8265fb1ea68", "03a3560eed26", "7837a10427d7", "8a77ea734509"]}, "3-4-6": {"tree": "【簽字授權 ＋ 基準語言 ＋ 副本・骨架】\n├ ㈦簽字能力及授權（Authorization and Ability to Execute）\n│   ├ 問題：一方是法人或代簽時，簽約者有無簽字能力\n│   ├ 要件：完全民事行為能力＋可簽署＋獲**合法且完整授權**\n│   ├ 未經合法授權 → 合約仍可能對一方或雙方不生效力\n│   ├ 範例 Each party **represents** that its undersigned officer is **duly authorized**\n│   │      to sign this Agreement **on its behalf**\n│   └ 架構為「表述」→ 不實時得主張終止（視準據法）或請求損害賠償\n├ ㈧基準語言（Language）\n│   ├ 目的：定本文語言＋定哪個版本為最終有效基準，避免翻譯差異\n│   ├ 範例 written and negotiated in **English**；任何翻譯（including Mandarin Chinese）\n│   │      is **for reference only**；In the event of conflict, this English version **shall govern**\n│   └ ⚠ 你讀的中文版只是參考；要爭就爭中文為準或 equally authentic\n└ ㈨副本條款（Counterpart）＋ 效力及其他\n    ├ (a) come into effect **upon signatures and seals** by both parties\n    │      超過一頁 → each page sealed on the **perforation**（騎縫章）\n    ├ (b) executed in **four counterparts** with same legal effect，雙方各執二份\n    │      3 working days 內寄達他方；**telefax 與原本同效**\n    └ 功能：解決遠距簽約／無法當面簽名的問題", "quiz": [{"q": "\"Each party represents that its undersigned officer is duly authorized…\" Why is it drafted as a **representation**?", "o": [["A", "to make it easier to read"], ["B", "so that if it is untrue the other party can terminate or claim damages"], ["C", "because representations are not binding"], ["D", "to satisfy the notary"]], "a": "(B) so that if it is untrue the other party can terminate or claim damages", "zh": "因為架構成表述，不實時他方得主張終止或請求損害賠償。", "e": "書中明言：由於其係架構為「表述」，如果事後發現簽名的人未經合法授權而導致合約無法被執行時，他方當事人可以主張終止合約（視準據法而定）或請求損害賠償。"}, {"q": "\"Any translation … (including Mandarin Chinese) is for reference only.\" For a Taiwanese party this means:", "o": [["A", "the Chinese version is equally binding"], ["B", "the Chinese version has no legal effect; disputes are decided on the English text"], ["C", "the Chinese version prevails in Taiwan"], ["D", "no translation may be made"]], "a": "(B) the Chinese version has no legal effect; disputes are decided on the English text", "zh": "中文版沒有法律效力，爭議以英文本為準。", "e": "這是台灣當事人最常踩的雷：談判時讀的是中文，出事時算的是英文。要爭就爭「中文為準」或雙版本 equally authentic。"}, {"q": "What does \"executed in four counterparts\" mean?", "o": [["A", "four photocopies are made"], ["B", "the contract is signed in four separate but identical originals, all equally effective"], ["C", "four parties must sign"], ["D", "the contract has four schedules"]], "a": "(B) the contract is signed in four separate but identical originals, all equally effective", "zh": "作成一式四份，各份皆為正本且具相同法律效力。", "e": "counterpart 不是「影本」。它是遠距簽約的法律基礎：各方各簽一份，合起來構成同一份合約。"}, {"q": "Why require each page to be \"sealed on the perforation\"?", "o": [["A", "to comply with tax law"], ["B", "to prevent pages being substituted later"], ["C", "to show the contract is confidential"], ["D", "to bind the schedules"]], "a": "(B) to prevent pages being substituted later", "zh": "騎縫章是為了防止日後抽換頁面。", "e": "書中說「以避免將來的爭議」。超過一頁的合約，簽名、用印、騎縫章三者齊備，始為完整有效的合約。"}, {"q": "\"The copy delivered through telefax shall be as valid as the original.\" The modern equivalent of this sentence would most likely refer to:", "o": [["A", "registered mail"], ["B", "PDF copies and electronic signatures"], ["C", "notarisation"], ["D", "company seals"]], "a": "(B) PDF copies and electronic signatures", "zh": "現代版會寫 PDF 掃描本與電子簽章與正本同效。", "e": "條款的功能是解決遠距簽約的問題；傳真只是 2012 年的技術背景，今天的對應寫法是 scanned PDF／DocuSign 等電子簽章。"}], "say": ["這一單元有三個條款。第一是簽字能力及授權。如果當事人一方是法人，或代表簽約的不是本人，就會有簽約者簽字能力的問題。合約必須經過雙方的授權代表簽字後才正式生效，代表必須具有完全民事行為能力、可以簽署合約，並獲得其所代表當事人之合法且完整授權。", "範例：Each party represents that its undersigned officer is duly authorized to sign this Agreement on its behalf. 請注意它架構為表述，representation，所以如果事後發現簽名的人未經合法授權，他方可以主張終止合約或請求損害賠償。", "第二是基準語言條款。英文合約一般約定以英文版本為有效基準版本。範例：This Agreement has been written and negotiated in English between the Parties. Any translation of this Agreement into a language other than English, including Mandarin Chinese, is for reference only. In the event of conflict between versions, this English version shall govern.", "這一句對台灣當事人非常重要：你讀的中文版只是參考，出事時以英文版論。要爭就爭中文版為準，或兩版本同等效力。", "第三是副本條款。範例 a 項：This Contract shall come into effect upon signatures and seals by both parties. If the Contract has more than one page, then each page should be sealed on the perforation. 也就是簽名、用印，超過一頁要加騎縫章。", "b 項：This Contract shall be executed in four counterparts with same legal effect, with each of the parties hereto holding two. The copy delivered through telefax shall be as valid as the original. 一式四份、各執二份、傳真與正本同效，這是在解決遠距簽約的問題。", "請記住 counterpart 不是影本，而是各方各簽一份、合起來構成同一份合約的正本。"], "saya": ["2443a4041bfc", "a18696041b9e", "fe84b1cffc6e", "95ba2aad8a9c", "5df463469bab", "22ef703045d0", "b14c42413e6a"]}, "3-4-7": {"tree": "【合約的解釋方式 Construction, Interpretation・骨架】\n├ ① 為什麼要約定\n│   ├ 定型化合約／一方提供的標準範本 → 法院可能作有利或不利某方的解釋\n│   └ ⚠ 消費交易即使準據法是外國法，**我國法院仍有介入空間**\n├ ② 我國法兩道防線\n│   ├ 民法§247-1（四款）：免除減輕預定人責任／加重他方責任／\n│   │                      使他方拋棄或限制權利／其他重大不利益 → 顯失公平者該部分無效\n│   └ 消保法§12（三款推定顯失公平）：違反平等互惠／與任意規定立法意旨顯相矛盾／\n│                                     致契約目的難以達成\n│   └ 實例：最高法院 91 年臺上字第 1577 號判決（飯店停車不負保管責任條款無效）\n├ ③ 例一 共同準備（排除 contra proferentem）\n│   └ deemed to have been **prepared jointly**；Any **ambiguity** shall not be\n│     **interpreted against** any party；商業交易易被接受，消費交易仍可能被推翻\n├ ④ 例二 單複數及陰陽性\n│   └ words in the **singular** number include the **plural**…；\n│     words of the **masculine** gender include the feminine and the neuter\n└ ⑤ 例三 標題（Heading or Title）\n    ├ 寫法一 names of the parties, the date and the **preamble** 皆**是**合約的一部分；\n    │        **captions and section numbers** inserted only as a matter of convenience；\n    │        they do not define, limit or describe the scope or intent\n    ├ 寫法二 titles **shall not be deemed a part** of this Agreement\n    └ 我國法 民法§98 應探求當事人真意 → 有約定者法院尊重；\n      無特別約定時法院仍可能參考標題作目的及體系解釋", "quiz": [{"q": "\"Any ambiguity herein shall not be interpreted against any party hereto\" is designed to exclude which common-law rule?", "o": [["A", "the parol evidence rule"], ["B", "contra proferentem — ambiguity is read against the party who drafted it"], ["C", "the doctrine of consideration"], ["D", "the entire agreement rule"]], "a": "(B) contra proferentem", "zh": "排除「不利於擬約人解釋」原則。", "e": "contra proferentem：條文有歧義時對提供範本的一方作不利解釋。約定「本合約視為雙方共同準備」就是要把它關掉。"}, {"q": "According to the book, even where the governing law is English or US law, Taiwanese courts may still intervene when:", "o": [["A", "the contract is in English"], ["B", "the transaction is a consumer transaction"], ["C", "the contract has an arbitration clause"], ["D", "the parties are both companies"]], "a": "(B) the transaction is a consumer transaction", "zh": "涉及消費交易時。", "e": "契約法會視當事人是一般消費者還是商業團體而調整契約自由的範圍。民法§247-1 與消保法§12 都可以讓顯失公平的條款無效，這是設計交易架構時必須特別注意的地方。"}, {"q": "Under the heading clause (version 1), which of the following IS part of the agreement?", "o": [["A", "the captions"], ["B", "the section numbers"], ["C", "the names of the parties, the date and the preamble"], ["D", "the table of contents"]], "a": "(C) the names of the parties, the date and the preamble", "zh": "當事人姓名、日期及前言是本合約的一部分。", "e": "這一句很重要：它確認**前言有合約效力**，只有標題與條號是為便利加入。回頭與第一單元 WHEREAS 不創設義務的原則一起讀。"}, {"q": "If the parties say nothing about headings, a Taiwanese court may:", "o": [["A", "must ignore the headings"], ["B", "still refer to the headings for purposive and systematic interpretation"], ["C", "declare the contract void"], ["D", "apply English law"]], "a": "(B) still refer to the headings for purposive and systematic interpretation", "zh": "仍有可能參考標題的意義作目的及體系解釋。", "e": "依民法§98 解釋合約應探求當事人真意。有明確約定者法院尊重；**無特別約定時標題仍可能被拿來解釋**，所以不希望標題有效力就要寫明。"}, {"q": "Which is a ground under 民法第 247 條之 1 for a standard-form term to be void?", "o": [["A", "加重他方當事人之責任者"], ["B", "條款以英文書寫"], ["C", "條款未經公證"], ["D", "條款字體過小"]], "a": "(A) 加重他方當事人之責任者", "zh": "加重他方當事人之責任，按其情形顯失公平者，該部分約定無效。", "e": "§247-1 四款：一、免除或減輕預定條款當事人之責任二、加重他方責任三、使他方拋棄權利或限制其行使權利四、其他於他方有重大不利益者。"}], "say": ["合約的解釋方式。有時合約當事人會就合約解釋的基本原則作約定，以避免合約對一方作有利或不利的解釋，特別是在定型化合約，或由一方當事人準備好的標準範本的時候。", "這裡有一個全章最重要的實務提醒：如果英文合約是涉及消費交易，即便準據法是英國、美國或其他國家，或合約中有解釋條款，我國的法院仍然有介入的空間。這是在撰擬或閱讀合約以及設計交易架構時，必須特別注意的地方。", "我國法有兩道防線。民法第二百四十七條之一，依當事人一方預定用於同類合約之條款而訂定之合約，有四款情形按其情形顯失公平者，該部分約定無效。消費者保護法第十二條，定型化合約中之條款違反誠信原則，對消費者顯失公平者，無效。", "例一，共同準備。This Agreement shall be deemed to have been prepared jointly by the parties hereof. Any ambiguity herein shall not be interpreted against any party hereto. 這是在排除英美法的 contra proferentem 原則，也就是歧義時對擬約人作不利解釋。", "例二，單複數及陰陽性。In this Agreement, unless the context otherwise requires, words in the singular number include the plural, and in the plural include the singular; and words of the masculine gender include the feminine and the neuter.", "例三，標題。The names of the parties, the date and the preamble first above written are part of this Agreement. The captions and section numbers appearing in this Agreement are inserted only as a matter of convenience. They do not define, limit or describe the scope or intent of the provisions of this Agreement.", "請特別注意，這一句確認了當事人姓名、日期與前言是合約的一部分，只有標題與條號不是。依我國民法第九十八條，解釋合約應探求當事人真意，如果沒有特別約定，法院仍有可能參考標題作目的及體系解釋。"], "saya": ["c5689067a175", "81a24046fe27", "94ec710dd147", "cb331a1245fe", "6e2e398638cd", "efc61d103f6b", "2e6c64c9828f"]}, "3-5-1": {"tree": "【表述、保證與承諾 概說・骨架】\n├ ① 為什麼要有：合約基礎是雙方對交易事實取得共識\n│   └ 表述與實際情況偏差 → 他方依賴而締約 → 交易偏差、危及商業目的、悖離公平\n├ ② 三個字的分工（時間軸）\n│   ├ **representations** 表述的事實（過去／現在已存在）\n│   ├ **warranties** 針對合約標的交易之各種保證\n│   └ **undertakings** 履行某種作為或不作為之承諾（未來）\n│   └ 違反的效果：要求**強制執行合約**，或依合約規定**終止合約**\n├ ③ 典型條目\n│   ├ 依有效力之法律設立、具合法資格進行交易\n│   ├ 具合法且充分之**授權**簽署合約\n│   ├ 保證履行交易的各種義務\n│   ├ 不損害第三人利益、不違反公序良俗\n│   └ 遵守相關法律（＋締約自由原則下的個別承諾）\n├ ④ ⚠ representation 在英美法的特殊意義\n│   ├ 指對**過去事實**的陳述\n│   ├ 不實或錯誤 → **misrepresentation** → 撤銷（set aside, revoke）或損害賠償\n│   │   （例：英國 Misrepresentation Act 1967）＋同時構成違約\n│   ├ 最嚴重者構成 **fraud, deceit**（詐欺）\n│   ├ 過失／無過失之不實陳述效果 → 視準據法國家法律而定\n│   └ 準據法非英美法系時不一定產生上述效果；但構成詐欺於我國仍可能依**民法§92**撤銷\n└ ⑤ ⚠ warranty 的兩種意義\n    ├ ㈠「非重要」條款（相對於 condition）→ 違反**不得終止**，但可請求損害賠償\n    └ ㈡「保證、擔保」（商品保固期間亦屬之）→ 至少可請求違約損害賠償", "quiz": [{"q": "In Anglo-American law, a **representation** is primarily a statement about:", "o": [["A", "what a party promises to do in future"], ["B", "facts that already exist or have occurred"], ["C", "the quality of goods for a warranty period"], ["D", "the governing law"]], "a": "(B) facts that already exist or have occurred", "zh": "對過去已經發生（或現在存在）的事實之陳述。", "e": "representation＝過去事實；undertaking＝未來的作為或不作為；warranty＝對標的交易的保證。三者時間軸不同，救濟也不同。"}, {"q": "Breach of a term classified as a **warranty** (first meaning) normally gives the innocent party:", "o": [["A", "the right to terminate the contract"], ["B", "damages only"], ["C", "the right to rescind for misrepresentation"], ["D", "no remedy at all"]], "a": "(B) damages only", "zh": "原則上只能請求損害賠償，不能終止合約。", "e": "warranty 是相對於 condition 的「非重要條款」。在合約沒有特別約定的情況下，違反 warranty 不會使未違約的一方取得終止合約的權利，但仍可請求損害賠償。"}, {"q": "A false statement of existing fact that induced the other party to contract may, under English law, allow the contract to be:", "o": [["A", "renewed"], ["B", "set aside (rescinded), or damages claimed"], ["C", "assigned"], ["D", "novated"]], "a": "(B) set aside (rescinded), or damages claimed", "zh": "可能撤銷整個合約，或請求損害賠償。", "e": "這就是 misrepresentation。英國有 Misrepresentation Act 1967。最嚴重的不實陳述構成 fraud／deceit；過失或無過失不實陳述的效果視準據法而定。"}, {"q": "If the governing law is Taiwanese law and one party has committed fraud, the book says the contract may still be rescinded under:", "o": [["A", "民法第 92 條"], ["B", "民法第 98 條"], ["C", "民法第 111 條"], ["D", "消保法第 12 條"]], "a": "(A) 民法第 92 條", "zh": "因被詐欺或被脅迫而為意思表示者，表意人得撤銷其意思表示。", "e": "書中補充：是否適用我國民法仍需視準據法條款的文義及適用範圍而定。表述這個概念特別存在於英美法系，準據法非英美法系時不一定產生 misrepresentation 的效果。"}, {"q": "Which is NOT listed in the book as a typical matter covered by representations and warranties?", "o": [["A", "legal capacity to enter into the transaction"], ["B", "due and sufficient authority to sign"], ["C", "the price adjustment mechanism"], ["D", "compliance with applicable laws"]], "a": "(C) the price adjustment mechanism", "zh": "價金調整機制不是表述保證的典型條目。", "e": "書中列舉：依有效力之法律具合法資格交易、具合法充分授權簽署、保證履行交易義務、不損害第三人利益或違反公序良俗、遵守相關法律。價金調整屬於約因／價金條款。"}], "say": ["表述、保證與承諾，概說。合約的基礎是合約雙方的一致協議，即雙方對於交易所涉及的某些事實取得共識。如果一方所作的表述與實際情況產生偏差，導致另一方依賴和信任該表述而做出締結合約的決定，就會出現交易偏差的問題。", "三個字的分工請記住。representations 是表述的事實，指向過去。warranties 是針對合約標的交易的各種保證。undertakings 是履行某種作為或不作為的承諾，指向未來。", "典型會寫進去的條目包括：確認依具有效力的法律具有合法的資格進行交易、具有合法的和充分的授權來簽署合約、保證履行交易的各種義務、保證不損害任何協力廠商的利益或違反公序良俗，以及保證遵守相關的法律。", "接下來是兩個最重要的觀念。第一，representation 表述，在英美法下指的是對過去事實上的陳述。如果內容有不實或錯誤，就可能構成不實陳述，misrepresentation，視準據法可能可以撤銷整個合約，或是請求損害賠償，例如依照英國的 Misrepresentation Act 1967。最嚴重的不實陳述就構成詐欺，fraud 或 deceit。", "如果準據法不是英美法系的國家，則不一定會產生前述效果；然而如果一方當事人構成詐欺，於我國仍然可能依民法第九十二條的規定撤銷合約。", "第二，warranty 在英美契約法上至少有兩種意思。第一個層面，warranty 指的是非重要的條款，相對於 condition 而言，違反 warranty 不會使未違約的一方取得終止合約的權利，但仍然可以請求損害賠償。第二個層面，warranty 指的是保證或擔保，一般商品的保固期間也屬於此類。", "請把這組對照背起來：condition 是重要條款，違反得終止合約；warranty 是非重要條款，違反原則上只能請求損害賠償。"], "saya": ["2cdbd2607ed1", "d6806d318a3a", "c5521a34fc98", "248253ac3498", "4cdf07a8631e", "9979e3e0f5f2", "4772f2ec08d9"]}, "3-5-2": {"tree": "【例一：股份買賣的表述保證・骨架】\n├ (a) 保證之真實性\n│   ├ 內容放在 **Schedule 3**，合稱 the \\\"Warranties\\\"\n│   ├ 由 Vendor 給 Purchaser\n│   └ **true and accurate**　as of 簽約日 **and** as of Completion Date or 31 May 2012,\n│     **whichever is earlier**（雙時點 repetition of warranties）\n├ (b) 賣方的揭露義務（簽約日後、完成日前）\n│   ├ **disclose promptly in writing upon being aware of** any event or circumstance\n│   ├ (i) constitutes a breach of or is **inconsistent with** any of the Warranties；或\n│   └ (ii) has a **material adverse effect** on the financial condition of the Company（MAE）\n└ (c) 買方的表述、保證及承諾\n    ├ 時點：as on the Completion Date **and at all times between** the date hereof and Completion\n    ├ (i) Purchaser 或 **Designated Subsidiary** 有 legal right, power and authority\n    │     to enter into, deliver and perform；構成 **legal, valid and binding obligations**\n    │     且 **enforceable in accordance with their respective terms**\n    └ (ii) 不會 (1) breach the **charter documents**（章程）\n          (2) result in a **violation under any applicable law**（不牴觸保證）", "quiz": [{"q": "\"are true and accurate as of the date of this Agreement and as of the Completion Date\" means the Warranties must be true:", "o": [["A", "only when the contract is signed"], ["B", "only at completion"], ["C", "at both signing and completion"], ["D", "only if the buyer asks"]], "a": "(C) at both signing and completion", "zh": "簽約日與完成日兩個時點都必須真實正確。", "e": "這叫 repetition of warranties（保證重述）。賣方會想只綁簽約日，買方會爭取綁雙時點甚至期間內隨時——(c) 項對買方就是用 at all times between 的更嚴格寫法。"}, {"q": "Why are the detailed warranties \"set out in Schedule 3\" rather than in the body?", "o": [["A", "because they are not binding"], ["B", "because they are long and detailed; the body keeps only the declaratory sentence"], ["C", "to keep them confidential"], ["D", "because schedules prevail over the body"]], "a": "(B) because they are long and detailed; the body keeps only the declaratory sentence", "zh": "保證細目很長，所以放附件，本文只留宣告句。", "e": "這是股權買賣的標準做法。**真正的風險都在附件裡**，審約時一定要翻到 Schedule 去逐條看，不能只讀本文。"}, {"q": "Under limb (b), when must the Vendor disclose?", "o": [["A", "at completion only"], ["B", "promptly in writing upon becoming aware of a breach or a material adverse effect"], ["C", "within 30 days of signing"], ["D", "only if the Purchaser asks"]], "a": "(B) promptly in writing upon becoming aware of a breach or a material adverse effect", "zh": "於知悉違反保證或有重大不利影響時，立即以書面揭露。", "e": "揭露義務的三個要素：觸發事由（breach／inconsistent／MAE）、時點（promptly upon being aware）、方式（in writing）。知悉標準是實際知悉還是應當知悉，實務上要寫清楚。"}, {"q": "\"material adverse effect\" is heavily negotiated mainly because:", "o": [["A", "it is hard to translate"], ["B", "what counts as \"material\", the yardstick used, and the carve-outs are all open to argument"], ["C", "it only applies to the buyer"], ["D", "it is prohibited in Taiwan"]], "a": "(B) what counts as \"material\", the yardstick used, and the carve-outs are all open to argument", "zh": "「重大」的門檻、衡量基準與排除事項都是爭點。", "e": "MAE／MAC 是併購合約最常吵的四個字。常見的 carve-out 包括總體經濟變動、產業普遍性變動、法令修改等不可歸責於標的公司的因素。"}, {"q": "Limb (c)(ii) is a so-called **no-conflict warranty**. What does it promise?", "o": [["A", "that the price is fair"], ["B", "that performing the agreement will not breach the charter documents or applicable law"], ["C", "that the company is profitable"], ["D", "that the shares are free from encumbrances"]], "a": "(B) that performing the agreement will not breach the charter documents or applicable law", "zh": "履行本合約不會違反章程，也不會違反任何適用的法律。", "e": "完整的 no-conflict warranty 通常有三支：不違章程（charter documents）、不違法（applicable law）、不違既有合約（existing agreements）。本例寫了前兩支。"}], "say": ["例一，股份買賣的表述、保證及承諾。", "a 項：The representations, warranties and undertakings set out in Schedule 3, collectively the Warranties, given by Vendor to Purchaser are true and accurate as of the date of this Agreement and as of the Completion Date or thirty-first May two thousand twelve, whichever is earlier.", "請注意兩個設計重點。第一，保證的細目放在附件三，本文只留宣告句，這是股權買賣的標準做法，真正的風險都在附件裡。第二，雙時點：簽約日與完成日都必須真實正確，這叫保證重述。", "b 項是賣方的揭露義務：Vendor hereby agrees to disclose promptly to Purchaser in writing upon being aware of any event or circumstance which constitutes a breach of or is inconsistent with any of the Warranties, or has a material adverse effect on the financial condition of the Company.", "material adverse effect，重大不利影響，是併購合約最常吵的四個字。要看三件事：重大的門檻怎麼定、以什麼為衡量基準、以及有沒有排除事項。", "c 項換成買方作表述、保證及承諾，而且時點更嚴：as on the Completion Date and at all times between the date hereof and the Completion Date，期間內隨時都必須為真。", "買方保證兩件事。第一，有 legal right, power and authority 簽訂、交付及履行本合約，且構成 legal, valid and binding obligations，並得依其各自條款強制執行。第二是不牴觸保證：不會違反買方或指定子公司的章程，也不會導致違反任何適用的法律。"], "saya": ["e7c7764e6478", "e33053f93d08", "053a98bd2552", "7d17fc1ac6a0", "8a7c1e7c3e57", "10c96ff79545", "3a1560718f83"]}, "3-5-3": {"tree": "【例二：代工生產的表述及保證・骨架】\n├ ① 架構：合約可**分別針對雙方**設計不同的表述及保證條款\n├ ② 買方 H 的陳述\n│   ├ (a) **has and will have throughout the Term** the full power, authority and legal right\n│   │     → 時態技巧：現在式＋未來式（避免下單後拒絕履行）\n│   ├ (b) 簽約不違反 H 與他人間既有之協議、權利或義務（獨家授權易衝突）\n│   └ 商標：has, and will have throughout the Term, **the right to authorize use of the Trademarks**\n├ ③ 生產者的陳述・權限（與 H 對稱）\n└ ④ 生產者的陳述・產品五大保證（on behalf of itself and its **affiliates**；\n    **in addition to all warranties implied by law**）\n    ├ (a) free from **defects in design, workmanship or materials**（含危害生命財產之瑕疵）\n    ├ (b) **merchantable quality** and **fit for H's purposes**；產地標示；\n    │     符合 **destination country** 之法律及其下命令規則\n    ├ (c) **not infringe** 第三人 personal, contractual or proprietary rights（含 IP）\n    ├ (d) **conform to all specifications** 及 H 接受之 **Product samples**\n    ├ (e) 具廣告所宣稱之 performance qualities and characteristics\n    ├ 法遵：9 部美國法（Wool Products Labeling / Textile Fiber Products Identification /\n    │       Fur Products Labeling / Hazardous Substances / Toy Safety / Consumer Products Safety /\n    │       Flammable Fabrics / Fair Packaging and Labeling / Food, Drug and Cosmetics）\n    ├ 勞工：**convict / forced / child / indentured labor** 於生產任何階段皆不得僱用\n    └ 效力保留：**survive** delivery、resale、expiration or termination\n          → 持續至 **applicable statute of limitations** 屆滿", "quiz": [{"q": "Why does the clause say \"has and will have throughout the Term\" rather than just \"has\"?", "o": [["A", "for stylistic reasons"], ["B", "so the warranty covers the whole contract period, not only the signing moment"], ["C", "because the Term is undefined"], ["D", "to limit liability"]], "a": "(B) so the warranty covers the whole contract period, not only the signing moment", "zh": "讓保證涵蓋整個合約存續期間，而不只是簽約當下。", "e": "書中特別點出：為求精確，於時態上其用語有包括現在及未來式（例 has and will have）。只寫 has 的話，期間內的變動就不在保證範圍。"}, {"q": "\"in addition to all warranties implied by law\" indicates that the contractual product warranties:", "o": [["A", "replace the statutory implied warranties"], ["B", "are added on top of the statutory implied warranties"], ["C", "exclude the statutory implied warranties"], ["D", "apply only if the law is silent"]], "a": "(B) are added on top of the statutory implied warranties", "zh": "契約保證是加在法定默示保證之上，而非取代。", "e": "相對的寫法是 disclaimer of implied warranties（排除默示保證），常見於賣方版本。本條是買方版本，兩者都保留。"}, {"q": "\"merchantable quality\" and \"fit for H's purposes\" are classic:", "o": [["A", "conditions precedent"], ["B", "implied warranties in sale of goods"], ["C", "indemnities"], ["D", "limitation of liability clauses"]], "a": "(B) implied warranties in sale of goods", "zh": "貨物買賣的默示保證。", "e": "merchantable quality（可銷售品質，英國 1994 年後改稱 satisfactory quality）與 fitness for a particular purpose（適於特定目的）是兩大默示保證。買方有特殊用途時務必寫明。"}, {"q": "The compliance warranty requires the Manufacturer to comply with the laws of:", "o": [["A", "the country of manufacture"], ["B", "the destination country, plus the listed United States statutes"], ["C", "the governing-law country only"], ["D", "any country the Manufacturer chooses"]], "a": "(B) the destination country, plus the listed United States statutes", "zh": "目的地國家的法律（含其下命令及規則），以及條款列舉的美國法。", "e": "法遵的基準是**目的地國**而非生產國。這一長串美國產品標示與安全法規（羊毛、紡織纖維、皮革、危險物質、玩具安全、消費品安全、可燃織品、公平包裝標示、食藥妝）是台廠出貨美國的必修清單。"}, {"q": "The labour warranty prohibits convict, forced, child and indentured labour:", "o": [["A", "only in the final assembly"], ["B", "in whole or in part, at any stage of the production or manufacture of the Products or components"], ["C", "only in the Manufacturer's own plant"], ["D", "only after the Term begins"]], "a": "(B) in whole or in part, at any stage of the production or manufacture of the Products or components", "zh": "於生產契約標的產品或任何零組件之任何階段，全部或一部皆不得僱用。", "e": "把整條供應鏈的每個階段都包進來。對應的法令是美國關稅法 §307 禁止強迫勞動商品進口；這是供應鏈 ESG 盡職調查的核心條款。"}, {"q": "How long do the Manufacturer's representations and warranties last?", "o": [["A", "until delivery of the Products"], ["B", "until the Products are resold"], ["C", "until expiration or termination of the Agreement"], ["D", "until the applicable statute of limitations expires"]], "a": "(D) until the applicable statute of limitations expires", "zh": "持續有效至相關法令之時效消滅為止。", "e": "條款明文排除了交付、轉售、期滿與終止這四個可能讓保證消滅的事由（survive），一路延伸到法定時效屆滿。這是風險最長尾的寫法，代工廠談判時應爭取訂明具體年限。"}], "say": ["例二，代工生產。合約也可以分別針對合約雙方設計不同的表述及保證條款。", "先看買方 H 的陳述：H warrants and represents that it has and will have throughout the Term, the full power, authority and legal right to execute and deliver this Agreement, and that entering into this Agreement does not violate any agreements, rights or obligations existing between H and any other person, entity, or corporation.", "請注意時態。書中特別點出，為求精確，用語包括現在及未來式，例如 has and will have。這在涉及多數買方當事人時很重要，以免有公司下訂單後拒絕履行。", "買方還保證：it has, and will have throughout the Term, the right to authorize use of the Trademarks to Manufacturer. 商標授權是代工合約的命脈，品牌方必須保證它真的有權授權下去。", "接著是生產者的產品保證，共五支箭。第一，be free from defects in design, workmanship or materials，設計、作工或材料無瑕疵。第二，be of merchantable quality and fit for H's purposes，可銷售品質且符合買方目的，並符合目的地國家所適用的法律。第三，not infringe or encroach upon any third parties' rights，不侵害第三人權利，包括智慧財產權。第四，conform to all specifications and Product samples，符合規格與樣本。第五，possess all performance qualities and characteristics claimed in advertisements，具有廣告所宣稱的品質及特色。", "再來是法遵與勞工。生產者保證遵守九部美國法令，包括羊毛產品標示法、紡織品纖維產品辨識法、皮革產品標示法、危險物質法、玩具安全法、消費者產品安全法、可燃織品法、公平包裝及標示法，以及食物藥物及化妝品法。並保證於生產產品或任何零組件之任何階段，不會僱用罪犯勞工、強迫勞動、童工或其他非法勞工。", "最後一句是效力保留：Manufacturer's representations and warranties herein shall survive the delivery of the Products, and any resale, as well as expiration or termination of this Agreement and shall continue in effect until the applicable statute of limitations expires. 保證不因交貨、轉售、合約終止而消滅，一路延伸到法定時效屆滿為止。這是對台灣代工廠而言風險最長尾的一句話。"], "saya": ["3cdd1b596edd", "8a8424ccd44b", "55e9dce51a4a", "fc7df31d4d46", "cb85170aa6b4", "f344972d0240", "2e47e173718d"]}};